1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Every wave is a circle — six equations, one picture

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,800
A point on a circle: one point, going round

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:08,000
sin t — its HEIGHT is sin

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,200
cos t — its WIDTH is cos

5
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:14,400
sin²t + cos²t = 1 — Pythagoras, on a hypotenuse of 1

6
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:17,600
e^(it) = cos t + i sin t — the point IS the exponential

7
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:20,800
e^(iπ) + 1 = 0 — put the point at half a turn and it lands on −1

8
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:24,000
Every wave you have ever seen is a point going round a circle.

9
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,800
Pause. Observe. Learn.  Follow for the math behind AI — @observer.collapse
